This test case contains

- Three business partners:
  - A sold-to, which is also bill-to and payer
  - A bill-to
  - A payer

- A contract where
  - The sold-to above is the sold-to and the payer
  - The bill-to above is the bill-to
  - The ship-to above is the ship-to

In order to test LOGON-6692, the dispocard for the sold-to/ship-to above must
not exist, such that it is created when the its accessed for the first time
after these requests have been sent and imported.

=> Only the contract header bill-to must initially be marked as possible bill-
to for the sales area.
